*[AVP]

< Banned-User-Target > ::= < AVP-Header: 3611 >
{ Target-RPAUID }
{ Target-PDUID }
*[AVP]

The Origin-App-Layer-User-Id AVP (AVP code 3600) is of type UTF8String
The Target-App-Layer-User-Id AVP (AVP code 3601) is of type UTF8String
The ProSe-Function-ID AVP (AVP code 3602) is of type OctetString
The ProSe-Request-Type AVP (AVP code 3603) is of type Unsigned32
The PDUID AVP (AVP code 3604) is of type OctetString
The Application-Data AVP (AVP code 3605) is of type UTF8String
The Allowed-Suffixes-Number AVP (AVP code 3606) is of type Unsigned32
The Monitor-Target AVP (AVP code 3607) is of type Grouped
The ProSe-Code-Suffix-Mask AVP (AVP code 3608) is of type Grouped
The Suffix-Code AVP (AVP code 3609) is of type OctetString
The Suffix-Mask AVP (AVP code 3610) is of type OctetString
The Banned-User-Target AVP (AVP code 3611) is of type Grouped
The Metadata-Indicator AVP (AVP code 3612) is of type Unsigned32
